        "mds:quote": "In the examples, excel- lent quality (Figure 11 right, with SNR Kari > 4) can be observed, showing an image comparable to laboratory/indoors EL imaging, while the satisfactory image quality example (Figure 11 center, with 4 > SNRKari > 1) shows an EL image with visible noise but distinguishable features that would enable the identi ﬁcation of most macroscopic PV cell faults."
