        "mds:value": "PV module",
        "mds:quote": "The Signal Amplitude values corrected for the aperture show similar results for the overcast and indoor conditions with slight ﬂuctuations. No ﬁlter scenario here did not satisfy the minimum satisfactory quality threshold for SNRKari, even at 3 ms exposure time. It is also the only instance where the corrected Signal Amplitude is less comparable to the results observed for indoor and overcast weather conditions (Figure 7 –9b)."
